Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Home=20visuals,=20self-authored=20skills,=20cle?=
 =?UTF-8?q?aner=20projects,=20=E2=9C=88=EF=B8=8E=20everywhere?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Hero background now matches the entrance screen's sunset-radial
  treatment; name is bigger; removed the "drag to look around" hint.
- About page skills are a plain hand-curated list from the actual
  GitHub profile README (no more auto-detected/live-fetched
  languages).
- Projects: pinned set trimmed to Splendor, Loan.ly, and Map N Mug;
  this portfolio's own repo and the profile-README repo are excluded
  from the live-fetched project list.
- GitHub contribution graph switched from a JSON fetch (fragile,
  CORS/reliability-dependent) to a simple <img> from a well-established
  chart service — much harder to fail, with a clearer error message
  that doesn't imply a misconfigured username.
- Replaced every "// label" and the custom SVG plane silhouette with
  the ✈︎ glyph, used consistently across the navbar mark, cursor,
  entrance flyover, scroll indicator, and section labels.
- Custom cursor is now bigger, glows, and trails a fading contrail
  that stretches with pointer speed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ADg6KJ9w2w5ZoasV1Pc5Zq
